				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>In the interview given to <strong>MOJO</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> admits she loves the leaked version of <strong>Living For Love</strong>!<br />
Here&#8217;s the extract taken by the magazine: </p>
<blockquote><p>MOJO hears two versions of her return single, LFL &#8212; the first stripped and harking back to deep house 1989-style, the second more layered with EDM synth figures. Asked by the singer which we prefer, we choose the first and receive a hug as reward. &#8220;<strong>That&#8217;s my favourite too</strong>,&#8221; she beams &#8220;<strong>it&#8217;s cool as fuck.</strong></p></blockquote>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget to <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-mojo-magazine-get-copy-hq-cover/20150122" target="_blank">BUY</a> the magazine! </p>
