				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>According to <strong><a href="http://www.vogue.com/946398/best-age-defying-fashion-kate-moss/" target="_blank">Vogue.com</a></strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> is one of the <strong>12 stylish women who are redefining the notion of age-appropriate dressing</strong>.</p>
<p><em>&#8220;There are certain women whose fashion choices transcend the very notion of age-appropriate dressing, those for whom age is nothing but a number&#8221;</em>, say at Vogue.com.</p>
<p>Here&#8217;s the motivation:</p>
<blockquote><p>Madonna:<br />
The singer and actress has conquered everything she’s put her mind to in her 55 years and doesn’t seem be giving up her fighting spirit. Whether it’s vogueing in cone bras or rocking ten-gallon hats, Madonna is constantly changing her look (not to mention her accent) based on mood. Her latest fashion triumph? The Givenchy by Riccardo Tisci look she sported to the 2013 Met Gala sans trousers.</p></blockquote>
